<p>Madine aayi hai zainab </p>

<p>Karbobala me jo guzri , rudaad sunati hai zainab<br />
madine aayi hai zainab</p>

<p>1) Shaam me lut kar karbobala se dekho watan me aayi hai ,<br />
Khoo'n me bhara bhayi ka kurta dekho zainab laayi hai ,<br />
Maara gaya majaya mera , ay Amma yeh duhayi hai <br />
 Madine aayi hai zainab&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;.</p>

<p>
2) Kaise kahu'n ke shaam ke zindaa'n me jo sakina par guzri ,<br />
Margayi pyaasi hichkiya'n lekar shaam ke zinda'n me bachi ,<br />
Touqe gira beemaar sambhale lashe bahen dafnayi hai <br />
 Madine aayi hai zainab&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;.</p>

<p>
3) Baara gale aur ek rasan thi baazaro me tamashai ,<br />
Amma. har ek gaam pa zainab teri sahi hai ruswai ,<br />
Jab darbaar ka saamna aaya beti bohat ghabrai hai<br />
 Madine aayi hai zainab&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;.</p>

<p>
4) Zulm kiya wo Ahle jafa ne ahle haram par wawaila ,<br />
Ajre Risalat aapki ummat ne kya hum ko khoob diya ,<br />
Bazuo'n par yeh neel rasan ke nana zainab laayi hai<br />
 Madine aayi hai zainab&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;.</p>

<p>
5) Karbobala se Qafela wapas aaya jo soughra ne suna ,<br />
Apni phupi zainab ko usne dekha aur na pehchana ,<br />
Ek Qayamat barpa hui asghar ko jab na payi hai<br />
 Madine aayi hai zainab&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;.</p>

<p>
6) Jaati hai dukhiya apne watan ko maine likha jab yeh noha ,<br />
